# Sources for the Marketplace listing and its GitHub-hosted Chinese edition.
# The packaged documents are generated from them into dist/docs (see below), so
# the sources and a backup left by an aborted swap must not ship in the VSIX.
README.marketplace.md
marketplace.zh-cn.md
.README.github.bak

# The repository landing page. Local packaging entries pass an explicit VSCE
# `readmePath` pointing at the generated English edition, and VSCE always forces
# the named readme in while the root README.md would otherwise ship unchanged as
# `extension/README.md`. Those two paths differ only by case, which VSCE rejects as
# a duplicate, so the root page must be excluded. The legacy publish scripts keep
# working: they pass no `readmePath`, and VSCE's default force-include of
# `README.md` re-adds the swapped listing content.
README.md

