# Ignore docs
docs/**
old_docs/**

# Changelog sources are maintained in both languages and ship as generated
# single-language notes. `docs/**` excludes the English current and both history
# files; the root Chinese current is excluded here, so no maintenance source
# is packaged alongside the generated English asset and Chinese sidecar.
# An explicit VSCE `changelogPath` does not cancel ignore rules, so the generated
# files must stay collectable instead of being merely referenced.
CHANGELOG.md

# Generated packaged documents: exactly four files, two official English assets and
# two ordinary Chinese editions.
#
# `dist/docs/**` is excluded by default so only the four generated documents can
# ever ship, and each is re-included by its exact path. The older single bilingual
# note is excluded explicitly: merely dropping its negation is not enough, because
# everything under `dist/` is packaged by default. Nothing here removes a file from
# disk; a leftover output or a foreign file simply stays out of the VSIX.
dist/docs/**
!dist/docs/README.en.md
!dist/docs/README.zh-CN.md
!dist/docs/CHANGELOG.en.md
!dist/docs/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md
dist/CHANGELOG.vsix.md

# Include default themes JSON files used in getTheme
!src/integrations/theme/default-themes/**

# Include icons
assets/icons/**
!assets/icons/icon.png
!assets/icons/icon.svg
!assets/icons/panel-dark.svg
!assets/icons/panel-light.svg
!assets/icons/dline-icon.woff

# Ignore E2E build files
e2e-build.mjs
e2e.vsix
test-results/
.playwright-mcp/
# Cross-process guard for the shared dist/ build output. It is live exactly when
# an E2E build packages dist/, so it must never become extension content.
dist/.e2e-lock/

# Ignore SDK and temp files
tmp_sdk_check/
tmp/
dist/tmp/
# Diagnostic bundles and other archives dropped at the repository root
*.zip
